      "text": "God will raise up a Messiah, or in other words, a Savior of world, 1 Ne. 10:4. the Lamb is the Savior, 1 Ne. 13:40. all flesh shall know that the Lord is the Savior, 1 Ne. 21:26 (22:12; 2 Ne. 6:18). the Mighty God shall deliver his covenant people, 2 Ne. 6:17. are you willing to follow your Savior into water, 2 Ne. 31:13 (Morm. 7:10). knowledge of the Savior will spread to every nation, Mosiah 3:20. Christ must die that salvation may come, Hel. 14:15. Mormon2 has reason to bless his Savior Jesus Christ, 3 Ne. 5:20. our Lord and Savior Jesus Christ, Morm. 3:14. words of the Savior will be fulfilled, Moro. 8:29.",
